<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally firm on light to moderate demand and offerings.  Select and Choice loin cuts higher, while rib and chuck cuts firm, and round cuts steady to weak. Beef trimmings not established -USDA</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>-----</p>
<p>120 Fab Lds  CH 1-3	CH 1-3	SE 1-3	SE 1-3</p>
<p>    50s Lds  550/700     700/850     550/700     700/850</p>
<p>12 Grd Lds ---------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Values =     103.54	103.97	 98.45	 98.02</p>
<p>Changes	   0.41	  0.53	  0.33	  0.24</p>
<p>Rib	  164.08	164.43	156.05	156.57</p>
<p>Chuck	 67.79	 67.24	 69.03	 66.59</p>
